    {"claim_id":"memory_claim_01","theme_id":"memory_chips_storage_control_value_chain_v1","source_id":"memory_603986_filing","claim_text":"A股存储晶圆收入集中在NOR、SLC NAND、利基DRAM和SRAM等产品，单公司宽口径存储收入不能替代具体品类和价格周期判断。","claim_type":"value_capture","confidence":0.94,"evidence_status":"verified","platform_use_status":"reviewed","supporting_source_ids":["memory_300223_filing","memory_688110_filing"],"affected_theme_nodes":["dram_nand_memory_die_products"]},
    {"claim_id":"memory_claim_02","theme_id":"memory_chips_storage_control_value_chain_v1","source_id":"memory_688110_filing","claim_text":"NOR、SLC NAND、EEPROM和利基DRAM依靠长生命周期、可靠性与客户认证形成专用存储利润池，但并购纳入和产品结构变化必须单独解释。","claim_type":"value_capture","confidence":0.93,"evidence_status":"verified","platform_use_status":"reviewed","supporting_source_ids":["memory_603986_filing","memory_300223_filing","memory_688766_filing"],"affected_theme_nodes":["specialty_nor_slc_nand_memory"]},
    {"claim_id":"memory_claim_03","theme_id":"memory_chips_storage_control_value_chain_v1","source_id":"memory_001309_filing","claim_text":"存储控制器的价值来自闪存管理、ECC、固件、量产工具、安全认证和客户适配；控制器随成品SSD销售时不能把整机收入全部视作芯片收入。","claim_type":"bottleneck","confidence":0.92,"evidence_status":"verified","platform_use_status":"reviewed","supporting_source_ids":["memory_301308_filing","memory_688525_filing","memory_300672_filing"],"affected_theme_nodes":["memory_controller_ssd_control_soc"]},
    {"claim_id":"memory_claim_04","theme_id":"memory_chips_storage_control_value_chain_v1","source_id":"memory_300302_filing","claim_text":"企业级SSD和全闪/分布式存储的商业化需要CPU平台适配、可靠性验证、项目交付和服务能力；在手订单、中标或参股公司回片不等于当期收入。","claim_type":"company_mapping","confidence":0.93,"evidence_status":"verified","platform_use_status":"reviewed","supporting_source_ids":["memory_301308_filing","memory_688525_filing","memory_001309_filing"],"affected_theme_nodes":["enterprise_ssd_storage_systems"]},
    {"claim_id":"memory_claim_05","theme_id":"memory_chips_storage_control_value_chain_v1","source_id":"memory_301308_filing","claim_text":"模组、eMMC/UFS、内存条和SSD集成把晶圆、主控、固件、封测和客户认证组合成产品，收入规模较大但对上游价格和库存占用敏感。","claim_type":"cost_structure","confidence":0.94,"evidence_status":"verified","platform_use_status":"reviewed","supporting_source_ids":["memory_688525_filing","memory_001309_filing","memory_688766_filing"],"affected_theme_nodes":["memory_module_packaging_integration"]},
